        "text": "\u3069\u3053\u306E\u304A\u5E97\u3082\u3001\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u6E96\u5099\u3057\u3066\n\u304A\u5BA2\u3055\u3093\u3092\u72EC\u308A\u5360\u3081\u3057\u305F\u3044\u308F\u3051\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Every shop wants to have the most delicious chocolate\nto attract all the customers."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u3044\u3044\u30EC\u30B7\u30D4\u3092\u304A\u5E97\u306B\u58F2\u308A\u8FBC\u3080\uFF01\n\u4E0A\u624B\u304F\u3044\u3051\u3070\u305F\u3093\u307E\u308A\u7A3C\u3052\u3061\u3083\u3046\u3063\u3066\u308F\u3051\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I\u0027ll sell them great recipes!\nIf it works out, I\u0027ll make a killing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306F\u306F\u3063\u3002\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3\u3055\u3093\u3089\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha! That\u0027s so like you, Heidi!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7686\u3055\u3093\u3001\u305D\u308C\u305E\u308C\u76EE\u7684\u304C\n\u306F\u3063\u304D\u308A\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone seems to have\ntheir own clear goals."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\uFF1F\u3000\u3069\u3046\u3057\u305F\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta? What\u0027s wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3048\u3001\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u4ECA\u306E\u8A71\u3092\u805E\u3044\u3066\u3001\u3088\u3046\u3084\u304F\u8FF7\u3044\u304C\u6674\u308C\u307E\u3057\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I\u0027m fine.\nHearing everyone\u0027s stories has helped clear my doubts."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\uFF1F\u3000\u4F5C\u308A\u305F\u3044\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3001\u6C7A\u307E\u3063\u305F\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Does that mean you\u0027ve decided what chocolate to make?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3044\u3064\u3044\u305F\u306E\uFF1F\n\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306B\u3082\u6559\u3048\u3066\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How did you figure it out?\nTell me too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306F\u2026\u2026\u79D8\u5BC6\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s... a secret."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3063\u3001\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3047\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whaaaat, why!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u307B\u3069\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306A\u3089\u3001\n\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u529B\u3067\u6C17\u4ED8\u3051\u308B\u306F\u305A\u3067\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An alchemist of your caliber should be able\nto figure it out on your own."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3041\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No fair~!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u306F\u3063\u3002\u3088\u304F\u5206\u304B\u3093\u306A\u3044\u3051\u3069\u3001\u5927\u5909\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306D\u3047",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha! Not sure what\u0027s going on, but looks tough~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FFA\u305F\u3061\u306F\u305D\u308D\u305D\u308D\u884C\u304F\u304B\u3002\n\u7D20\u6750\u3092\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u306A\u3001\u4E8C\u4EBA\u3068\u3082\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We should get going.\nThanks for the materials, you two!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30F3\u30C4\u30A7",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3061\u3089\u3053\u305D\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u3067\u306F\u623B\u308A\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3001\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you as well.\nLet\u0027s head back, Sophie."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F85\u3063\u3066\u3088\u3001\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait up, Plachta~!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]